FORM CORR_MAINT_ZMV_JNY_COL USING VALUE(CM_ACTION) RC.
  DATA: RETCODE LIKE SY-SUBRC, COUNT TYPE I, TRSP_KEYLEN TYPE SYFLENG.
  FIELD-SYMBOLS: <TAB_KEY_X> TYPE X.
  CLEAR RC.
MOVE ZMV_JNY_COL-JOURNEY_ID TO
ZRAK_T_JNY_COL-JOURNEY_ID .
MOVE ZMV_JNY_COL-STEP_ID TO
ZRAK_T_JNY_COL-STEP_ID .
